[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3719129512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114681#issuecomment-3719129512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114681","id":3719129512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7drWmo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T14:26:32Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T14:26:32Z","body":"> but there were so many new (?) methods to remove\r\n\r\nA lot of these are at least 4-5 years old, so they must have been missed","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3719129512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720608703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114681#issuecomment-3720608703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114681","id":3720608703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dw_u_","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T20:13:48Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T20:38:51Z","body":"I'm a little late, but I'd like to speak in defense of empty constructors. If a class or struct doesn't define any constructors (or perhaps a special method, I'm not sure), C++ implicitly defines its own constructor overloads, which isn't obvious.\r\n\r\nExample: Let's say you have a struct with two fields (like `Vector2`). You want to either use the default values ​​for these fields or always specify **both** fields. But if you don't define a constructor, C++ generates constructor overloads (or allows you to use aggregate initialization, not sure about the terminology) for **any** number of arguments, from zero to the number of fields in the struct. This means you can initialize just the first field in the struct.\r\n\r\nAlso, defining an empty constructor is useful for disabling the curly brace initialization. This could be important if you (or someone else) at some point want to rearrange the fields in the struct or add a new field that is implied to be required.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Code</summary>\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nstruct A {\r\n    int x = 0;\r\n    int y = 0;\r\n};\r\n\r\nstruct B {\r\n    int x = 0;\r\n    int y = 0;\r\n\r\n    B() {}\r\n};\r\n\r\nstruct C {\r\n    int x = 0;\r\n    int y = 0;\r\n\r\n    C(int p_x, int p_y) : x(p_x), y(p_y) {}\r\n};\r\n\r\nstruct D {\r\n    int x = 0;\r\n    int y = 0;\r\n\r\n    D() {}\r\n    D(int p_x, int p_y) : x(p_x), y(p_y) {}\r\n};\r\n\r\nvoid test() {\r\n    A a0 = {};       // OK\r\n    A a1 = { 1 };    // OK\r\n    A a2 = { 1, 2 }; // OK\r\n\r\n    B b0 = {};       // OK\r\n    B b1 = { 1 };    // Error\r\n    B b2 = { 1, 2 }; // Error\r\n\r\n    C c0 = {};       // Error\r\n    C c1 = { 1 };    // Error\r\n    C c2 = { 1, 2 }; // OK\r\n\r\n    D d0 = {};       // OK\r\n    D d1 = { 1 };    // Error\r\n    D d2 = { 1, 2 }; // OK\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720608703/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720639552","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114681#issuecomment-3720639552","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114681","id":3720639552,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dxHRA","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T20:23:51Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T20:23:51Z","body":"Sounds like something that is a concern in very limited cases?\r\nMost of the changes here are applied to full-blown classes, especially ones that use GDCLASS. Is it even possible to initialize their fields like that? (they are almost always private too)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720639552/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720681875","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114681#issuecomment-3720681875","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114681","id":3720681875,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dxRmT","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T20:36:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T20:36:26Z","body":"Yes, this probably only affects structs or classes without private/protected fields.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720681875/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]